{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>店主表示真的很無語，希望有媒體朋友也幫幫他發發視頻。</p>\n<p>6月15日下午17點，博主發微博稱已經在今天下午16:00收到法院電話，本案已經撤訴。</p>\n<p>博主最後表示，感謝這些天幫發話的網絡朋友，還有媒體朋友。謝謝大家！</p>\n<p>遇見小面創始人道歉：無償贈送商標，中止律所合作</p>\n<p>別把情分當理所當然！渝見小面老闆反要遇見小面向全國小商户道歉</p>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_25/806122B1D86E5984269A126E28C52B85CC180361_size187_w1320_h2114.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1080_h1920_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_25/DE2613EA74C9CEBE1344DABF367A03E8DD7E09BC_size114_w1080_h1920.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_25/5149105C604171C7DC6B477081CF6FEAE9EF5CD6_size149_w1320_h1195.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0615/7e35c213c139a6c.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_25/806122B1D86E5984269A126E28C52B85CC180361_size187_w1320_h2114.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1080_h1920_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_25/DE2613EA74C9CEBE1344DABF367A03E8DD7E09BC_size114_w1080_h1920.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1125_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_25/5149105C604171C7DC6B477081CF6FEAE9EF5CD6_size149_w1320_h1195.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-15T13:19:11.106745+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":7,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"unknown"}}